भञ्ज् भन॑क्ति pp. भग्न (q.v.) break, bend,
curve;
 scatter, disperse;
 defeat, conquer;
 frustrate, disappoint,
destroy, annihilate;
 P. भज्यते with intr. mg. (C. भञ्जयति w.
शूले pierce with a pale*). — अभि break, destroy. अव break down
(tr.). निस् break asunder, split. प्र break, destroy;
 rout, defeat
(an army). वि break to pieces;
 scatter, distribute;
 frustrate,
disappoint. सम् break, crush. — Cf. परिभग्न, संभग्न.

भञ्जन a. & m. breaking, breaker, destroyer (—˚);
 n.
the act of breaking, destroying, interrupting, disturbing.
